Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,《Someday》\NOneRepublic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Somedays I'm treadin' the water\N♪ 有时我在水中跋涉 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.83,0:00:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel like it's getting deep\N♪ 感觉它越来越深 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Some nights I drown in the weight of the things that I think I need\N♪ 有些夜晚，我抑郁在自以为重要的事情下 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I feel incomplete\N♪ 有时我感觉自己不完整 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah\N♪ 是啊 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But you always say to me\N♪ 但你总是对我说 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Say to me\N♪ 对我说 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you say\N♪ 你说 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday when we're older\N♪ 当我们老去的某天 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be shinin' like we're gold\N♪ 我们会如黄金般闪耀 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.32,0:00:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't we?\N♪ 不是吗？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't we?\N♪ 不是吗？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday when we're older\N♪ 当我们老去的某天 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be yours and you'll be mine\N♪ 我将属于你，你也将属于我 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Be happy, happy\N♪ 要快乐，快乐 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you say\N♪ 你说 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday when we're older\N♪ 当我们老去的某天 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:01:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't worry about the things that we don't need\N♪ 我们不会再为不需要的东西担忧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need\N♪ 我们不需要 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And one day down the line\N♪ 而未来的某一天 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we both run out of time, we're gonna see\N♪ 在我们都耗尽时间之前，我们会明白 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That someday we'll be all that we need\N♪ 终有一天我们会成为彼此的全部 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday we'll be all that we need\N♪ 终有一天我们会成为彼此的全部 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.80,0:01:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been the best, been the worst\N♪ 我曾是最好的，也曾是最坏的 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.22,0:01:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Been a ghost in a crowded room\N♪ 曾在拥挤的房间里像个幽灵 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah - yeah - yeah - yeah - yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I took a chance, took a turn, took a dive, and it led to you\N♪ 我抓住机会，转过弯，纵身一跃，最终找到了你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah - yeah - yeah - yeah - yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.60,0:01:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So many times that I wish we could be anywhere but here\N♪ 无数次我希望我们能去任何地方，除了这里 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So many times that I wish I could see what you see so clear\N♪ 无数次我希望能像你一样看得如此清楚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.32,0:01:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So clear\N♪ 如此清楚 ♪
